{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t西藏那曲市巴青縣昨晚發生7級淺層地震，中國地震局啟動二級應急響應。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n根據中國地震台網測定，地震發生在昨晚10時33分，震源深度10公里，暫時未清楚傷亡或損毀報告。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n本港天文台分析指，地震震央位於那曲之東北約200公里。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.688346+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:32:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:41.057208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:12.170018+00:00","content_hash":"ffcece877293d48e4da94575936ead18a60fb290987128423139b29f38777c09","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}